        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/ore-energys-iron-air-technology-ldes-applications-trade-offs-deployments-and-next-gen-cells/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ore Energy’s iron-air technology: LDES applications, trade-offs, deployments and next-gen cells — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/catl-upgraded-to-aaa-wartsila-downgraded-to-bb-in-bankability-report-q2-update/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CATL upgraded to AAA, Wärtsilä downgraded to BB in Bankability Report Q2 update — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/catl-eve-energy-lead-chinese-manufacturers-battery-storage-cell-price-hikes/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CATL, EVE Energy lead Chinese manufacturers’ battery storage cell price hikes — Energy Storage News</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.energy-storage.news/energy-fiji-partners-with-epc-renewables-on-240mwh-solar-plus-storage-site/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Energy Fiji partners with EPC Renewables on 240MWh solar-plus-storage site — Energy Storage News</a></li>
